ssionDenied\\\",\\\"code\\\":\\\"admission-denied\\\",\\\"line\\\":3377,\\\"column\\\":25,\\\"ordinal\\\":4,\\\"details\\\":{}}\",\"taskId\":\"morning-ledger\"},{\"attempt\":1,\"comment\":\"local://campaign/flashnext/attempt-receipts/16\",\"reason\":\"Stage `lane` faulted.\\n\\n{\\\"name\\\":\\\"FlowAdmissionDenied\\\",\\\"code\\\":\\\"admission-denied\\\",\\\"line\\\":3377,\\\"column\\\":25,\\\"ordinal\\\":4,\\\"details\\\":{}}\",\"taskId\":\"catalog-handoff\"},{\"attempt\":2,\"comment\":\"local://campaign/flashnext/attempt-receipts/17\",\"reason\":\"Stage `lane` faulted.\\n\\n{\\\"name\\\":\\\"FlowAdmissionDenied\\\",\\\"code\\\":\\\"admission-denied\\\",\\\"line\\\":3377,\\\"column\\\":25,\\\"ordinal\\\":4,\\\"details\\\":{}}\",\"taskId\":\"catalog-handoff\"},{\"attempt\":1,\"comment\":\"local://campaign/flashnext/attempt-receipts/19\",\"reason\":\"Stage `lane` faulted.\\n\\n{\\\"name\\\":\\\"FlowAdmissionDenied\\\",\\\"code\\\":\\\"admission-denied\\\",\\\"line\\\":3377,\\\"column\\\":25,\\\"ordinal\\\":4,\\\"details\\\":{}}\",\"taskId\":\"rdma-package\"}],\"schemaVersion\":1,\"source\":{\"path\":\"silent-factory-worklists/flashnext.json\",\"revision\":\"42dddacd6e2b652620e1b19f483808a0f2d95097\",\"sha256\":\"sha256:a4c707bc9fd18c69b6b67c1ceb94299752b08ae87422cf8d8cd48cb66dbc3a3b\"},\"tasks\":[{\"acceptanceCriteria\":[{\"argv\":[\"bash\",\"-euc\",\"bash -n container/build.sh && grep -q 'torch==2.13.0+rocm7.14.0' container/Containerfile && grep -q 'repo.amd.com/rocm/whl-multi-arch' container/Containerfile && grep -q 'mecattaf/vllm' container/Containerfile && grep -q 'flashnext:dev' container/build.sh && grep -qi 'MIT' container/Containerfile\"],\"description\":\"The recipe pins the exact wheel set, the fork branch, and the image tag, and is syntax-clean.\",\"id\":\"recipe-pins\"}],\"conflictDomains\":[\"container\",\"results/receipts\"],\"deliveredBehaviors\":[\"A reproducible image build from the fork at the exactly pinned wheel set\",\"A build receipt the receipts gate can grade\"],\"dependencies\":[],\"goal\":\"THE PRIMARY ENGINE LANE of spec ruling P4 (the nix wiring in the tree is the graduation lane — leave it alone). Write container/Containerfile and container/build.sh implementing IMPORTS.md sections 1 and 2 and spec claim 3.1 (specs/flashnext/spec.md#r3), designed for overnight iteration: the fork checkout and its build directory are bind-mounted volumes with ccache enabled so a one-line patch rebuild recompiles only what changed, and the image can be entered for edit-and-restart iteration without a rebuild. Containerfile: Ubuntu 24.04; python 3.12 venv at /opt/venv; install torch 2.13.0+rocm7.14.0 and torchvision 0.28.0+rocm7.14.0 and the matching triton wheel from the vendor stable index https://repo.amd.com/rocm/whl-multi-arch/ (record the exact resolved triton version); git clone --depth 1 --branch flashnext https://github.com/mecattaf/vllm and build it from source against those wheels for GPU target gfx1151 (relax nothing: the torch pin is satisfied exactly; drop audio extras rather than adding torchaudio); COPY container/rootfs/ into site-packages so the fn_ instrument modules land importable; write /opt/flashnext/build-info.json inside the image carrying the fork commit, torch, triton, and image build time. build.sh: run the packaging tests first, then podman build tagged flashnext:dev, then write results/receipts/build.json as {step:\\\"build\\\", status, ts, data:{torch, triton, fork_commit, image_digest}} with status fail on any error. Credit the recipe shape to the MIT toolbox recipe named in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md in the Containerfile header. Boundaries: touch only container/ and results/receipts/.\",\"id\":\"container-recipe\",\"kind\":\"implementation\",\"readFirst\":{\"specSections\":[\"specs/flashnext/spec.md#r3\",\"IMPORTS.md\",\"specs/flashnext/evidence/kyuz0-rocm10.md\"],\"styleReferences\":[\"scripts/run-smoke.sh\"]},\"revision\":\"sha256:6e8621b55de3a3a9c646edd59fb1c26372db042e230f9d2d3ec5a4e08