ord already in the lane — is committed on `tally-work/flashnext-e55ddef1f9e3/instruments`. `git status --porcelain` prints nothing.\n\nOne thing worth flagging, outside my write boundary: there is no in-repo `FN_PROFILE` driver or `install()` call site for `fn_synctrace`/`fn_expert_union` — those live engine-side in the fork patch, which belongs to the container-recipe domain, not `container/rootfs` or `tests`. The modules are correct and importable as specified; wiring them to a call site is a different task's surface.","ttft_ms":1800,"ttft_stream_ms":981,"time_to_request_ms":18,"type":"result","duration_ms":151546,"uuid":"470ab825-011c-42f6-8bac-5cc5903ecf71"}
